1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:02,515
Words don't arrive with meaning attached.

2
00:00:02,765 --> 00:00:06,693
An embedding turns a word into numbers, coordinates on a meaning map.

3
00:00:07,033 --> 00:00:11,764
Puppy and dog land close. Kitten joins the neighbourhood. Car stays farther away.

4
00:00:12,014 --> 00:00:15,195
Now the computer can compare meaning by measuring distance.

5
00:00:15,445 --> 00:00:18,165
Embeddings turn language into relationships.

